## Vendor Lifecycle

### Vendor Selection

| Phase | Activities | Owner |
|-------|------------|-------|
| Requirements | Define needs, criteria | Business Owner |
| RFP/RFI | Issue request, evaluate | Procurement |
| Evaluation | Demo, POC, scoring | Evaluation Team |
| Negotiation | Terms, pricing | Procurement + Legal |
| Security Review | Assessment | Security |
| Approval | Contract approval | Finance + Legal |
| Onboarding | Integration, access | IT + Business |

### Evaluation Criteria

| Criteria | Weight | Description |
|----------|--------|-------------|
| Functionality | 25% | Meets requirements |
| Security | 20% | Security posture |
| Cost | 20% | TCO, value |
| Support | 15% | Service levels |
| Integration | 10% | Technical fit |
| Company | 10% | Stability, reputation |

### Vendor Scoring

| Score | Rating | Action |
|-------|--------|--------|
| 4.0-5.0 | Excellent | Proceed |
| 3.0-3.9 | Good | Proceed with conditions |
| 2.0-2.9 | Adequate | Additional review |
| < 2.0 | Poor | Do not proceed |

