## Security Requirements

### Vendor Security Assessment

| Tier | Assessment | Frequency |
|------|------------|-----------|
| Strategic | Full assessment + audit | Annual |
| Key | Security questionnaire | Annual |
| Operational | Self-attestation | Bi-annual |
| Transactional | Baseline check | At onboarding |

### Required Certifications

| Certification | Required For |
|---------------|--------------|
| SOC 2 Type II | All data access vendors |
| HIPAA BAA | PHI access vendors |
| ISO 27001 | Strategic vendors |
| PCI DSS | Payment processors |

### Security Requirements

| Requirement | Description |
|-------------|-------------|
| Data Encryption | At rest and in transit |
| Access Controls | RBAC, MFA |
| Incident Response | 24-hour notification |
| Audit Logging | 1 year retention |
| Data Location | US or approved regions |
| Subprocessors | Pre-approval required |

