| Rating | Count | Description |
|--------|-------|-------------|
| Low | 92 | No data access, standard controls |
| Medium | 38 | Limited data, good controls |
| High | 15 | Sensitive data, enhanced review |
| Critical | 2 | Core operations, continuous monitoring |

